OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a victim impact statement read in
OL,7,Fcourt, Alfie's mother Jennifer Gray
OL,8,Fsaid: "We are broken forever. The
OL,9,Fheartbreak never ceases. It will never
OL,10,Fgo away."
